WEBVTT

00:02:59.358 --> 00:03:03.459
Dobija svoj krastavac, zagriza i potom -

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:06.285
baca ga nazad nama.

00:03:06.616 --> 00:03:09.854
U međuvremenu, Vinter se ponovo trampi
i dobija još jedno zrno grožđa

00:03:09.854 --> 00:03:13.158
i ima Lensinu potpunu pažnju dok ga jede.

00:03:13.555 --> 00:03:14.728
Ovaj put,

00:03:14.752 --> 00:03:17.714
Lens nije toliko uzbuđena zbog trgovine.

00:03:17.738 --> 00:03:20.363
Međutim, na kraju ipak pristaje.

00:03:20.387 --> 00:03:23.323
No kada ovaj put dobije krastavac,

00:03:23.347 --> 00:03:26.037
čak ni ne zagriza

00:03:26.061 --> 00:03:28.461
pre nego što ga baci nazad nama.

00:03:28.879 --> 00:03:31.895
Očito da Lens jedino želi krastavac,